OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for most, with
OL,6,Fany early shallow fog patches soon
OL,7,Fclearing. Cloudier conditions will
OL,8,Ftentatively build around lunchtime but
OL,9,Fthe cloud will often break to allow
OL,10,Fsunny spells through the afternoon.
OL,11,FFeeling warm in the sun.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells across
OL,14,Fsouthern areas, while cloud gradually
OL,15,Fincreases further north. Towards dawn,
OL,16,Fa few mist or fog patches may develop,
OL,17,Fparticularly across parts of Hampshire
OL,18,Fand Sussex.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
