OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry, warm and rather sunny
OL,6,Facross southern areas but cloudier
OL,7,Ffurther north, with the odd chance of
OL,8,Fa heavy shower in the afternoon,
OL,9,Fbriefly accompanied by strong winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,12,Fand sunny on Thursday after a chilly
OL,13,Fstart. Cloud increasing on Friday with
OL,14,Fpatchy rain arriving overnight.
OL,15,FLargely dry Saturday but possibly
OL,16,Fremaining cloudy throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
